{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdYPxdrhNNjFeAKrHxjS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Between June and September, DoorDash launched three agent-style ordering tools of its own: Ask DoorDash, a chatbot that takes orders from prompts and photos; a CLI agent; and a text-to-order agent. On its third-quarter earnings call, CEO Tony Xu said that third-party agents such as Muse, Instinct and Fo have sent maybe several hundred orders in total, and that users still mostly order through DoorDash's app.\n\nThe article doesn't give DoorDash's reasoning, so any link between these two facts is an inference. It looks like the company is putting natural-language ordering inside products it controls while the outside channel stays very small. The one reported exception is an MCP DoorDash released so that other chatbots can place orders for corporate ordering. For the broader consumer case, the agents most people would reach for are not yet bringing much volume.\n\nXu's stance on third-party agents is to keep watching them. He said the company wants to learn more about agentic use cases and build a healthy relationship with agent makers. He also said that advertising within these agents could become an opportunity for DoorDash in the future. That points to a possible role for agents as a place where DoorDash would reach customers, though the article reports it only as a possibility.\n\nHow fast outside agents grow may depend partly on what merchants allow. The article notes that websites are still deciding whether to let agents access their content, with Amazon blocking personal agents and Walmart welcoming them to win business from competitors. DoorDash has not said which way it will go on that question, and for now the several hundred orders are the only measure it has offered of how much demand exists."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":986,"cache_read_input_tokens":2082,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":986},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"583f75f7-6bfc-4c1d-ab0d-2a357534bce9","uuid":"4402cda3-b821-4489-b0ad-8393021dea42","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:23:09.557Z","request_id":"req_011CgdYPxSTBc1nuUYTMmbKi"}
